          "text": "nk'uko Umwana w'umuntu ataje gukorerwa, ahubwo yaje gukorera abandi no gutangira ubugingo bwe kuba incungu ya benshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.20.28",
